# PROVENANCE: measured from a factory-fresh genuine DESFire EV3 2K with Proxmark3 on 2026-11-01
# (random UID; PICC master key left at its all-zero default, format left enabled).
# PROVISIONAL BATCH "value-rights-2026-11-01": every capture of this batch carries
# `capture-batch: value-rights-2026-11-01` and `capture-status: provisional`, so the whole batch can
# be thrown away together if the card proves faulty (see docs/capture-batches.md).
#
# What this measures: which access right each value-file command needs, on one value file whose
# rights are changed section by section (ChangeFileSettings, change right free), with every command
# tried unauthenticated, authenticated as application key 0, and as key 1. The application has two
# keys, both at their zero default; authentication is real DES (legacy) with the card's own random
# recovered from its first answer, replayed with `inject-random`.
# Observed, for Read / Write / Read&Write rights each free (E), denied (F), key 0 or key 1:
#   * GetValue works with any one of the Read, Write or Read&Write rights.
#   * Debit works with any one of the Read, Write or Read&Write rights.
#   * LimitedCredit works with the Write or Read&Write right; Read alone is denied.
#   * Credit needs the Read&Write right; Read or Write alone is denied.
#   * A command that no right can ever allow answers 9D; one that a key could allow answers AE
#     until that key authenticates.
# Each case runs its commands with the value put back by AbortTransaction after a success, so every
# case starts from the same balance and the same LimitedCredit allowance (one committed Debit of 30).
name: genuine EV3 2K value-file rights for GetValue, Credit, Debit and LimitedCredit (provisional batch)
case-id: hardware-physical-ev3-2k-value-rights
origin: physical-card
capture-batch: value-rights-2026-11-01
capture-status: provisional
feature-version: 6
source: physical-card-proxmark3
requires: auth-d40
uid: 04112233445566
picc-generation: EV3
picc-storage: 2048
picc-key-settings-1: 0F
picc-key-settings-2: 01
picc-key-len: 16
picc-auth-mode: D40
picc-hardware-version: 04010133001605
picc-software-version: 04010103001605

